# There are no generated pages (D-405): the record is data/*.csv (and data/inbox/*.csv),
# and the Rx7 app shows it. Anything else a view layer ever produces is ignored here so it
# can never be committed and never be mistaken for the record.
*.html
*.svg
*.stamp
VIEW.*
MANUAL.*
view.json
outputs/
!99-ARCHIVE/**/*.html
!99-ARCHIVE/**/*.svg
# The harness-leg drawings (D-385) are generated like DECISIONS.md and committed like it:
# they are the bench copy and the car record. Only this folder is excepted.
!02-PROJECTS/01-electrical/00-design/diagrams/**/*.svg

# Rendered page names from v2 and v3 - never regenerate these (D-405).
DESIGN.md
SHOPPING-LIST.md
INSTALL.md
QUESTIONS.md
LOG.md
WIRE-TABLES.md
ANSWERS.md
DECISIONS.md
BLOCKS.md
TODO.md
PICKS.md
SPEC.md
!99-ARCHIVE/**

# Scratch
__pycache__/
*.py[co]
*.tmp
*.typed-in.bak

# IDE and OS state
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Built binaries (Linux has no extension to match, so each one is named)
*.exe
*.o
*.obj
02-PROJECTS/01-electrical/00-design/display-unit/firmware/icu_sim/sim
02-PROJECTS/01-electrical/00-design/tests/test
02-PROJECTS/01-electrical/00-design/tests/test_bt817
02-PROJECTS/01-electrical/00-design/tests/test_dcu

# KiCad, under the cad/ folders of 02-PROJECTS/01-electrical/00-design/ only: each part's
# (control-unit/cad/, display-unit/cad/, D-496, D-497). Those folders are not areas and
# not the view layer (see 00-design/README.md): each is a CAD tool drawing one board. The exported
# schematic SVG is the exception to the *.svg rule above, because a hardware change is
# unreviewable without a picture - an S-expression diff of coordinate tuples is not one.
!02-PROJECTS/01-electrical/00-design/**/cad/**/*.svg
*.kicad_prl
*-backups/
*.kicad_sch-bak
*.kicad_pcb-bak
_autosave-*
fp-info-cache
*-erc.rpt
*-drc.rpt
02-PROJECTS/01-electrical/00-design/**/cad/**/*.pdf
02-PROJECTS/01-electrical/00-design/**/cad/**/*.net
02-PROJECTS/01-electrical/00-design/**/cad/**/net.txt
02-PROJECTS/01-electrical/00-design/tests/test_radio
02-PROJECTS/01-electrical/00-design/display-unit/firmware/icu_sim/renders/

# KiCad 10's local history and lock files (per machine, never versioned)
02-PROJECTS/01-electrical/00-design/**/cad/**/.history/
02-PROJECTS/01-electrical/00-design/**/cad/**/~*.lck

# The Rx7 app (02-APP/app) is source code: its own HTML and SVG are tracked.
# Its dependencies and build output are not.
!02-APP/app/**/*.html
!02-APP/app/**/*.svg
02-APP/app/node_modules/
02-APP/app/dist/
02-APP/app/build/
02-APP/app/test-results/
02-APP/app/playwright-report/
02-APP/app/src-tauri/target/
02-APP/app/src-tauri/gen/android/**/build/
02-APP/app/src-tauri/gen/android/.gradle/
02-APP/app/public/pyodide/
02-APP/app/public/core/
# The design in 3D (D-505, Y23): the glb files are rebuilt from the boards, the mock-ups and the
# PMU's STEP by 02-PROJECTS/01-electrical/00-design/tools/export_glb.py - 48 MB the set, over the
# 20 MB the row allows in git. scene.json beside them is committed.
02-APP/app/public/design/**/*.glb
*.keystore
*.jks
keystore.properties
02-APP/app/fixture/

# The source files (D-573): manuals, catalogues, datasheets and the research waves' raw output, kept
# on this PC in 00-CAR/library; each sources row's local_path names its file. Mazda's and the
# vendors' copyrights keep them out of a public repository.
00-CAR/library/

# The purchased 3D model (S-037) and what is built from it stay on this PC, in 02-cad/model/sa:
# the repository is public and the model's licence does not allow passing it on. The renders in
# 02-APP/app/public/car are committed; the model itself never is.
02-PROJECTS/02-cad/model/sa/

# The free CAD library (02-cad/model/library): every downloaded model stays on this PC. Their
# licences vary (CC-BY, CC-BY-NC, 3D Warehouse, manufacturer terms) and the repository is public,
# so none is passed on. The catalogue is the record (00-CAR's cad table); the scripts that read
# the files are committed.
02-PROJECTS/02-cad/model/library/

# The raw copy of the Fedora PC model folder (2026-10-13, holds the bought SA model and a 1.6 GB
# library.zip backup), merged into the folders above: never in git
02-PROJECTS/02-cad/model/fedora-copy/
# The simulation vendors' models and datasheets (00-CAR sources S-491..S-499): their licences keep them out of git
02-PROJECTS/01-electrical/00-design/sim/vendor/
